### **1. BACKEND AUTOMATION ROUTES** (`internal/api/router.go`)

**Base Path:** `/api/v1/automations`

| Method | Path | Handler | Purpose |
|--------|------|---------|---------|
| `GET` | `/` | `List()` | List all automations (supports `?enabled=true` filter) |
| `POST` | `/` | `Create()` | Create new automation |
| `GET` | `/events` | SSE stream | Real-time automation SSE events |
| `POST` | `/export` | `ExportBatch()` | Batch export automations |
| `POST` | `/import` | `Import()` | Batch import automations |
| `GET` | `/{id}` | `Get()` | Fetch single automation by ID |
| `GET` | `/{id}/export` | `ExportOne()` | Export single automation |
| `GET` | `/{id}/history` | `ListAutomationHistory()` | Fetch automation execution history |
| `PUT` | `/{id}` | `Update()` | Full-replacement update |
| `DELETE` | `/{id}` | `Delete()` | Delete automation |
| `PATCH` | `/{id}/toggle` | `Toggle()` | Enable/disable automation |
| `PATCH` | `/{id}/re-enable` | `ReEnable()` | Re-enable auto-disabled automation |
| `POST` | `/{id}/test-run` | `TestRun()` | Execute automation in test mode |
| `POST` | `/{id}/undo` | `UndoLast()` | Undo last action execution |
| `GET` | `/history/{historyId}` | `GetHistoryDetail()` | Fetch specific history record |
| `POST` | `/webhook/{token}` | Webhook receiver | External webhook trigger endpoint |

